(7714910, 1268245, 100831, '<td valign="top">For some, defining abstract is difficult. For me, when I''m allowed to wander through an image without any idea what I''m supposed to see it begins to fall into the category. But in order to be a good abstract, it needs form and space and, in this case, color. That makes sense to me. I could argue about the title but somehow that makes sense here too. Good one.</td>', 'For some, defining abstract is difficult. For me, when I''m allowed to wander through an image without any idea what I''m supposed to see it begins to fall into the category. But in order to be a good abstract, it needs form and space and, in this case, color. That makes sense to me. I could argue about the title but somehow that makes sense here too. Good one.', '2022-02-19 19:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714911, 1268180, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great find and title. Step by step... higher and higher... of course it adds to the purpose that he is of the order and that this journey is very calculated. The more I think about this, the better it gets. Art?  I think so.</td>', 'Great find and title. Step by step... higher and higher... of course it adds to the purpose that he is of the order and that this journey is very calculated. The more I think about this, the better it gets. Art?  I think so.', '2022-02-19 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
