(7715820, 1268368, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. Given this was an Extended editing challenge, I incorrectly assumed that this image was made from multiple shots. To learn you were literally in the middle of it -- I cannot imagine. A once in a lifetime experience. I would love to see a large print that reveals the detail in the cropped entry as you got closer.</td>', 'This is amazing. Given this was an Extended editing challenge, I incorrectly assumed that this image was made from multiple shots. To learn you were literally in the middle of it -- I cannot imagine. A once in a lifetime experience. I would love to see a large print that reveals the detail in the cropped entry as you got closer.', '2022-03-02 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
